[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Demo Requirements

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @program

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TVC-REQ-001
LEVEL: L1
REQUIREMENT_TYPE: Functional
TITLE: Demo Attitude Estimate
APPLICABLE_SUBSYSTEM: Avionics, Flight_Software
SUBTEAM_OWNER: Electrical, Software, Controls
INDIVIDUAL_OWNER: Systems Lead
VEHICLE_CONFIGURATION: TVC-F1
MISSION_PHASE: Powered ascent
FLIGHT_ATTEMPT: Flight 1
OPEN_ITEM_STATUS: None
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Analysis
VERIFICATION_PLAN_LINK: docs/verification/attitude-estimate-analysis.md
STATUS: Draft
STATEMENT: The vehicle shall estimate roll, pitch, and yaw attitude during powered ascent.
RATIONALE: This demo requirement exists to exercise parent traceability, verification-plan links, and generated StrictDoc views before real TVC requirements are authored.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: TVC-MO-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TVC-REQ-002
LEVEL: L1
REQUIREMENT_TYPE: Safety
TITLE: Demo Range Compliance
APPLICABLE_SUBSYSTEM: N_A
SUBTEAM_OWNER: Systems
INDIVIDUAL_OWNER: Systems Lead
VEHICLE_CONFIGURATION: All
MISSION_PHASE: All
FLIGHT_ATTEMPT: All
OPEN_ITEM_STATUS: None
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Inspection
STATUS: Draft
STATEMENT: The vehicle shall comply with applicable range safety rules.
RATIONALE: This demo requirement exists to exercise traceability from a mission constraint to a safety requirement.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: TVC-MC-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TVC-REQ-003
LEVEL: L2
REQUIREMENT_TYPE: Performance
TITLE: Demo Log Rate
APPLICABLE_SUBSYSTEM: Flight_Software
SUBTEAM_OWNER: Software, Controls
INDIVIDUAL_OWNER: Software Lead
VEHICLE_CONFIGURATION: TVC-F1
MISSION_PHASE: Powered ascent
FLIGHT_ATTEMPT: Flight 1
OPEN_ITEM_STATUS: None
VERIFICATION_METHOD: Test
STATUS: Draft
STATEMENT: The vehicle shall log attitude estimates at no less than 50 hertz during powered ascent.
RATIONALE: This demo requirement exists to exercise L2-to-L1 traceability and performance-requirement rendering.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: TVC-REQ-001
